 the required time and temperature, and ensure the doors are closed.\n\nStep 4. Forming: Dip the mold into the dough for 1 second to shape it, then arrange the required number of pieces on the left tray.\n\nStep 5. Baking: Put on gloves, place the tray in the oven, and set the time and temperature; remove the tray promptly after baking to prevent burning.\n\nStep 6. Packaging: Sort the cookies into the correct boxes based on labels, seal the lids, and attach an expiration date sticker to the front.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "Step 1. Weighing: Measure flour, sugar, salt, and baking powder according to the designated lines or weights (200g/100g/10g/10g) and transfer them to the bowl.\n\nStep 2. Kneading: Add the dry ingredients, butter, and milk into the mixer; set the specific time and strength, then press the start button.\n\nStep 3. Fermentation: Place the dough in the fermenter or refrigerator as instructed, set the required time and temperature, and ensure the doors are closed.\n\nStep 4. Forming: Dip the mold into the dough for 1 second to shape it, then arrange the required number of pieces on the left tray.\n\nStep 5. Baking: Put on gloves, place the tray in the oven, and set the time and temperature; remove the tray promptly after baking to prevent burning.\n\nStep 6. Packaging: Sort the cookies into the correct boxes based on labels, seal the lids, and attach an expiration date sticker to the front.", "genre_names": ["Learning"], "has_in_app_ads": false, "id": "9793671960744956", "is_approved": false, "is_concept": false, "is_enterprise_enabled": false, "organization": {"id": "", "is_authorized_for_quest": false, "application_groupings": {"count": 0, "nodes": [], "__typename": "", "typename_enum": 0}}, "platform": "", "publisher_name": "ContentsDA Inc.", "required_space_adjusted": 362115054, "requiredSpaceAdjustedFormatted": "345.34 MB", "total_installed_space": 281068039, "totalInstalledSpaceFormatted": "268.05 MB", "quality_rating_aggregate